BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:OCAD University Senate Meeting
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260928T151500
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260928T181500
UID:ocad-university-senate-meeting-19@ocadu.ca
DESCRIPTION:OCAD University Senate Meeting\n\nThe next regular meeting of 
 the OCAD University Senate is scheduled to take place on Monday\, Septembe
 r 28\, 2026 from 3:15 pm – 6:15 pm EDT. The Senate is responsible for th
 e establishment and regulation of academic policy\, standards and procedur
 es at OCAD University. The Senate and its many committees are in charge of
  all matters pertaining to OCAD U academic resources\, academic programmin
 g\, academic strategic planning\, student affairs and any other such matte
 rs relating to academic issues. More information can be found on the OCAD 
 U Senate webpage . If you would like to attend as a guest\, or if you have
  any questions\, please contact David Wagschal\, Quality Assurance Officer
  & Associate Senate Secretary at dwagschal@ocadu.ca.
URL:https://www.ocadu.ca/events-and-exhibitions/ocad-university-senate-mee
 ting-19
X-SOURCE:OCAD University
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Welcome Day - Fall 2026 Orientation
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260908T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260908T160000
UID:welcome-day-fall-2026-orientation@ocadu.ca
DESCRIPTION:Welcome Day - Fall 2026 Orientation\n\nAll new students are in
 vited to Welcome Day\, where we will kick off the academic year. Meet your
  peers\, meet our staff\, learn about our services and supports\, and conn
 ect with the wider neighbourhood and community. 8:30 to 9:30 a.m. Check in
  at the Welcome Tent to get your Welcome Kit\, team button and lunch wrist
 band and join your team 9:30 a.m. to 12:30 p.m. Welcome remarks\, meet you
 r peers and join in the fun! Meet your Team Captains\, get your team pin\,
  and meet other students from your program and faculty! Collect your free 
 Welcome Kit Welcome Remarks with greetings from Indigenous Elder Liz Osawa
 mick\, President & Vice-Chancellor Ana Serrano\, Vice-Provost\, Students &
  International\, Deanne Fisher and your Student Union Check out our Studen
 t Services Expo where you can meet our staff and learn about our many supp
 orts and resources Participate in creative activities\, insider panel disc
 ussions\, mindfulness activities\, and chances to win prizes! 12:30 to 4 p
 .m. OCAD U's annual Community Fair featuring: The Above Ground Art Supplie
 s Art Materials Fair Student clubs and campus organizations\, Special gues
 t hosts from OCAD U LiVE Enjoy free lunch\, samples\, give-aways\, and so 
 much more! 2 to 3 p.m. International Student Coffee Break Levels 5 and 6\,
  230 Richmond St. West Quiet Space: Need to get away from the noise and ac
 tion of Welcome Day! for a little break\, meditation\, or quiet contemplat
 ion? The Student Lounge (MCA 274\, Level 2\, 100 McCaul St.) has been desi
 gnated as Quiet Space during orientation. Another option is our Multi-fait
 h Room (MCA 657\, Level 6\, 100 McCaul St.). For more information\, visit 
 ocadu.ca/orientation OCAD U strives to provide inclusive and accessible op
 portunities for the entire OCAD U community to participate fully. If you r
 equire any type of accommodation to participate in this activity\, please 
 let us know: campuslife@ocadu.ca Photography: Please be advised that OCAD 
 U hosted events may be documented through photographs and video. These ima
 ges may be used by the University for promotional\, advertising\, and educ
 ational purposes. By participating in our events\, both on campus and off-
 site\, you consent to allowing OCAD U to document and use your images and 
 likeness. However\, if you do not want us to use a photo or video of you\,
  please don’t hesitate to let a team member know when you arrive at the 
 event.
LOCATION:Main Building & Rosalie Sharp Centre for Design (MCA) 100 McCaul 
 Street 100 McCaul St.
URL:https://www.ocadu.ca/events-and-exhibitions/welcome-day-fall-2026-orie
 ntation
X-SOURCE:OCAD University
END:VEVENT
